<title>FINLAND: AAMULEHTI PLANS NEW FINNISH MEDIA MAJOR.</title>
<headline>AAMULEHTI PLANS NEW FINNISH MEDIA MAJOR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish media group Aamulehti Oy said on Tuesday it planned to merge with domestic commercial broadcaster MTV Oy, creating a new major in the Finnish communication business.</p>
<p>In a statement detailing its plans, Aamulehti said the new company, with net annual sales around 2.5 billion markka and 2,600 full-time employees, would also be strong also amid accelerating international competition.</p>
</text>
